# Self-healing dev convenience: test/conftest.py creates this symlink
# on demand so `import bslz4_to_sparse` works against an in-place
# build (setup.py's package_dir maps the name to src/, but a plain
# sys.path entry needs a directory that's actually *named*
# bslz4_to_sparse) -- not something to track, always recreated.
/bslz4_to_sparse
